# using https://sequencediagram.org/
title The T-Project : city

participant "TNT2\nmain loop" as TNT2
participant "TNT3\nCity entry point" as TNT3
participant "TNT13\nDraw city" as TNT13
participant "TNT4\nCity dialogs" as TNT4
participant "TNT11\nShop" as TNT11
participant "TNT17\nHostel" as TNT17
participant "TNT10\nUser menu" as TNT10

activate TNT3
note over TNT3:Lbl I
TNT3->TNT13:load+draw current city
TNT13-->TNT13:StoPict 1
note over TNT3:Lbl 1
activate TNT3
note over TNT3:Convert city coordinates I, J\nto matrix coordinates G, H\n\nFrac Mat A[H,G]→b₀
TNT3->TNT4:b₀=0.1 → dialogs
TNT3->TNT11:b₀=0.2 → shop
TNT3->TNT17:b₀=0.3 → hostel
TNT3-->TNT3:Getkey→θ
TNT3->TNT10:θ=48 [menu]
TNT3->TNT2:θ=29 [f6] → Goto W (world)
note over TNT3:move according to θ\n\nGoto 1